["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"王晶×罗永浩！谁还记得大导演张彻楚原？我死了什么都不需要留下 首部剧情电影计划 网大\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-06-11-cn2d7912-王晶-港片衰落不是因为回归-而是1993年台湾市场崩盘/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/95375ff339622f0a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"罗\"><span class=\"dur\">3:25:39</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">罗永浩的十字路口</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0611</span></div>\n<h2>王晶：港片衰落不是因为回归，而是1993年台湾市场崩盘</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">港片衰落常被归因于九七回归后题材收紧，但王晶说真正转折点是1993年香港电影人逼台湾全面开放好莱坞片配额，自断了养活港片产业的台湾市场。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>4</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">香港电影</span><span class=\"tag\">黑帮经济</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"告别算力焦虑！中国AI不再靠英伟达，华为做对了什么？ KV Cache MoE CUDA CANN SIMD/SMT\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-06-08-laoshi-黄仁勋称灾难-deepseek甩开英伟达跑通万亿参数模型/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/e5a42471a6aa9b97-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"老\"><span class=\"dur\">23:20</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">老石谈芯</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0608</span></div>\n<h2>黄仁勋称灾难：DeepSeek甩开英伟达跑通万亿参数模型</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">DeepSeek V4在设计之初就与华为昇腾做芯片到模型的协同，成本只有国际竞品的七分之一，证明算力路线不止一条。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">国产算力</span><span class=\"tag\">华为昇腾</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"Elon Musk and Ian Dahl, SpaceX Vision Update, June 8, 2026 Kardashev scale TerraFab mass driver rapid reusability\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-06-08-ch-space-span-science-policy-and-news-马斯克-要把数据中心搬上太空-三年内入轨运力冲到百万吨/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/bdc1e66c9a590f28-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">31:17</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Space SPAN (Science Policy and News)</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0608</span></div>\n<h2>马斯克：要把数据中心搬上太空，三年内入轨运力冲到百万吨</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Starship的快速可重复使用是太空算力跃升的前提，SpaceX计划三年内把到轨运力从每年2500吨推到百万吨级，为太空AI数据中心铺路。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">SpaceX</span><span class=\"tag\">太空算力</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"144. 对阳萌的4小时访谈：消费电子死与生、第三类公司、端侧模型、产品方法、游戏模式 存算一体 冯诺依曼架构 N-time efficiency worker SackKit 康威定律\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-06-08-zhangxiaojun-安克做芯片-从五系到七系-一家消费电子公司的补课/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/99b672a2ad0c5ace-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">3:38:52</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0608</span></div>\n<h2>安克做芯片：从五系到七系，一家消费电子公司的补课</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">安克前11年顺风顺水，2022年却发现自己建的产品线打不过外面的独角兽。阳萌的解法不是换人，而是把公司从五系产品公司改造成七系创新公司——代价是补上第一性、求极致、共成长这套价值观。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">消费电子</span><span class=\"tag\">存算一体</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Reinventing Entropy | Compression is Intelligence Part 1 prefix-free code noiseless coding theorem entropy rate cross-entropy loss\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-06-07-karpathy-压缩就是智能-预测与压缩是同一枚硬币的两面/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/911ed142cc051a24-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">32:25</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Andrej Karpathy</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0607</span></div>\n<h2>压缩就是智能：预测与压缩是同一枚硬币的两面</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">信息论说预测和压缩在数学上等价，所以语言模型的预训练目标可以重新理解为造一台最高效的文本压缩器，而不只是预测下一个 token。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">信息论</span><span class=\"tag\">压缩</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"Nvidia CEO Jensen Huang &amp; Dell CEO Michael Dell on Agentic AI, Memory Demand and China |... harness agentic AI AI factory physical AI\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-06-01-ch-bloomberg-podcasts-ai-算力瓶颈不再是-gpu-黄仁勋说是内存/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/915a917b58e6e5bf-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"B\"><span class=\"dur\">20:45</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Bloomberg Podcasts</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0601</span></div>\n<h2>AI 算力瓶颈不再是 GPU,黄仁勋说是内存</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">黄仁勋说三年前就已经把未来的内存需求曲线讲给美光和SK海力士听，这次供应紧张不是历史周期性的内存涨跌，而是AI算力结构性变化的结果。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">算力供应链</span><span class=\"tag\">内存</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"JUST RECORDED: Elon Musk Interviewed by JP Morgan&#x27;s Jamie Dimon rail gun / mass driver TerraFab\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-06-01-ch-brighter-with-herbert-spacex上市不缺钱-是为了造十万颗卫星和太空数据中心/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/5a79e32a33f2acea-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"B\"><span class=\"dur\">21:08</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Brighter with Herbert</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0601</span></div>\n<h2>SpaceX上市不缺钱，是为了造十万颗卫星和太空数据中心</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">马斯克说SpaceX早在2014、2015年就现金流为正、根本不缺钱，这次上市是为了给超10万颗V3卫星和太空AI数据中心的巨额资本开支融资。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">太空产业</span><span class=\"tag\">卫星通信</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"Nvidia’s Jensen Huang on the AI revolution, job losses and what drives him | Full interview five-layer cake agentic AI wabi-sabi\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-06-01-ch-cna-你不会被ai取代-而是被更会用ai的人取代/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7f589adb2af3b47f-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">56:13</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">CNA</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0601</span></div>\n<h2>你不会被AI取代，而是被更会用AI的人取代</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">黄仁勋以放射科为例反驳失业论：AI被预测最先淘汰放射科医生，结果这个岗位的人数、薪资反而双双上涨。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI就业影响</span><span class=\"tag\">中美科技竞争</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"LIVE: Nvidia CEO Jensen Huang speaks at Computex harness KV caching Mixture of Experts (MoE) DPU tokens per watt\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-06-01-ch-reuters-过去cpu是为人类造的-英伟达说智能体需要完全不同的cpu/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c79e5a115e3c337e-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"R\"><span class=\"dur\">2:06:25</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Reuters</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0601</span></div>\n<h2>过去CPU是为人类造的，英伟达说智能体需要完全不同的CPU</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">智能体按纳秒计时、旧CPU按秒出租逻辑设计，英伟达为此造了全新架构的Vera CPU，称这会是比旧CPU市场更大的新市场。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI基础设施</span><span class=\"tag\">智能体</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"NVIDIA&#x27;s Jensen Huang on Building the Dynamo of the Intelligence Age Dynamo agentic AI tokens\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-06-01-ch-sequoia-capital-黄仁勋-你不会输给ai-会输给会用ai的人/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/aea229243f5dcf5f-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">41:21</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Sequoia Capital</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0601</span></div>\n<h2>黄仁勋：你不会输给AI，会输给会用AI的人</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">黄仁勋用「放射科医生被预言淘汰十二年后人数反而更多」反驳AI消灭岗位论——自动化提升的是任务效率，不是职业本身，岗位的「目的」始终需要人。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI基础设施</span><span class=\"tag\">算力</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-hay=\"266: If ADHD Medication Doesn’t Help Kids Learn, What Does? MTA study crossover design DSM misrecognition\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-06-01-parentmojo-adhd-药物改得了行为-改不了学习/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/70c340acb32275d2-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"Y\"><span class=\"dur\">30:41</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Your Parenting Mojo</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0601</span></div>\n<h2>ADHD 药物改得了行为，改不了学习</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Barkley 把 ADHD 比作糖尿病，但 64% 的人会反复移出诊断标准；药物提高服从性却不改善学习，MTA 长期随访证实无学业优势，真正有效的是小班差异化教学。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">ADHD</span><span class=\"tag\">儿童教育</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"Toast: Sticky SaaS - [Business Breakdowns, EP.247] net take rate SaaSpocalypse TAM MOIC flywheel market\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-05-29-breakdowns-行业15-的年流失率-反而成了toast抢份额的武器/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/f5791491c49c13a7-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"B\"><span class=\"dur\">49:24</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Business Breakdowns</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0529</span></div>\n<h2>行业15%的年流失率，反而成了Toast抢份额的武器</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">每年有10万到12万家美国餐厅倒闭又重开，高流失率原本该是坏消息，却给了Toast这个挑战者源源不断的新客户入口，它靠产品优势正拿下其中约一半的新开业餐厅。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">垂直SaaS</span><span class=\"tag\">支付处理</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"罗永浩的X字路口！当一群情绪不稳定的杠精讨论起情绪稳定 POA\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-05-29-cn2d7912-对方朝车窗吐痰泄愤-他说这证明自己更幸福/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/e575a124b5b62c2b-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"罗\"><span class=\"dur\">2:33:35</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">罗永浩的十字路口</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0529</span></div>\n<h2>对方朝车窗吐痰泄愤，他说这证明自己更幸福</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">「幸福者退让原则」是说：冲突时先判断谁更幸福，幸福的一方才该让——这套逻辑把躲在车里不还手，包装成了理性而不是害怕对方人高马大。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">情绪管理</span><span class=\"tag\">脱口秀</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"143. 对何小鹏的第二次访谈：更大赌注、人形机器人Iron诞生、那场意外、技术剧变下CEO、GX和缝合怪 VLA 缝合怪 SOP T1\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-05-28-zhangxiaojun-何小鹏-通用人形机器人99-99-会死-我们赌那两成胜率/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/392e7ab9c3c64df9-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">1:28:21</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0528</span></div>\n<h2>何小鹏：通用人形机器人99.99%会死，我们赌那两成胜率</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">小鹏把花了小几十亿的自动驾驶体系整个停掉，因为用软件方法论加AI工具箱做出来的只是「AI缝合怪」。他给通用人形机器人的胜率是两成，而机器人创业难度是造车的20到100倍。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>4</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">人形机器人</span><span class=\"tag\">自动驾驶</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"142. 雨森的创投观察第2集：Harness、下一个字节、2026大机会和Stanley Druckenmiller Harness context engineering sandbox out of distribution agency\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-05-27-zhangxiaojun-harness-才是操作系统-模型只是插拔的处理器/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/38abc82541e9f530-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">2:18:32</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0527</span></div>\n<h2>Harness 才是操作系统，模型只是插拔的处理器</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">模型公司做的是提炼基础油的炼油厂，真正值钱的是化工厂和汽车公司。用户对 Harness 更忠诚——他会换模型，但不想换掉存着自己记忆的那个壳。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 应用</span><span class=\"tag\">Harness</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"Episode 195: Doug Cooke discusses NASA’s challenges in the space race to the Moon and Mars EDL (Entry, Descent, and Landing) cryogenic fuel transfer new space / commercial\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-05-21-stemtalk-nasa前高管-当前登月方案过于复杂-2028年根本无法实现/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/40c94fa1d0f627de-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">58:47</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">STEM-Talk</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0521</span></div>\n<h2>NASA前高管：当前登月方案过于复杂，2028年根本无法实现</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">道格·库克认为，登月舱依赖未经验证的低温推进剂在轨转移与细高塔式结构，让任务成功率层层打折，中国的简化方案反而更可能先登月。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">航天</span><span class=\"tag\">NASA</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"郑执×罗永浩！总是赶末班车的人，可以改进时间管理......也可以拥有一辆属于自己的车 匿名作家计划 万亩大造林\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-05-21-cn2d7912-三到五年内-ai将让零资源新导演和资深导演站在同一起跑线/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c21e5eeeb2a439b8-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"罗\"><span class=\"dur\">2:39:45</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">罗永浩的十字路口</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0521</span></div>\n<h2>三到五年内，AI将让零资源新导演和资深导演站在同一起跑线</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">郑执说电影创作资源曾是有和没有之间零和一百的关系，但AI使实拍成本指数级下降后，没资源的穷小子和功成名就的导演会站在同一个起跑线上。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">东北文艺复兴</span><span class=\"tag\">导演处女作</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Vanguard ETF mutualization 2&amp;20 / carry sales load\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-05-18-acquired-放弃全部利润-vanguard把自己做成了无法复制的对手/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/9b271b26bce642e3-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">3:48:05</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Acquired</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0518</span></div>\n<h2>放弃全部利润，Vanguard把自己做成了无法复制的对手</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Vanguard的护城河不是规模或品牌，而是一个经济学悖论：想复制它的对手要么保留利润、放弃价格竞争力，要么降到零利润、无法持续运营。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">指数基金</span><span class=\"tag\">被动投资</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"141. Freda的投资札记第2集：Tokenmaxxing、把电机塞进蒸汽机、接力赛变篮球赛、孤独、人的连接 Tokenmaxxing recursive self-improvement economic diffusion Neo Labs Acquire Hire\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-05-18-zhangxiaojun-ai-时代最稀缺的不是信息-是有人味的对话/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/86731af431732da4-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">1:23:53</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0518</span></div>\n<h2>AI 时代最稀缺的不是信息，是有人味的对话</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">当 90% 到 95% 的信息性内容都能直接问 AI 拿到，以信息交换为目的的对话正在被掏空，人和人之间剩下的只有情感连接。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>17</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI投资</span><span class=\"tag\">模型公司</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"李想×罗永浩！李想的理想：通过 AI 技术，让普通人也过上富豪的生活 具身智能 VLA 线控底盘 动态数据流架构\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-05-13-cn2d7912-理想要把富豪才有的司机管家生活卖给普通人/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/37ee0608f621bf45-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"罗\"><span class=\"dur\">2:20:59</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">罗永浩的十字路口</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0513</span></div>\n<h2>理想要把富豪才有的司机管家生活卖给普通人</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">李想判断，十年后买L4自动驾驶车和买家用机器人的会是同一批人——AI的价值不是替代工作，而是把富豪才雇得起的司机和管家，变成普通家庭也能消费的服务。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">具身智能</span><span class=\"tag\">自动驾驶</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"140. 对姚顺宇的4小时访谈：请允许我小疯一下！在Anthropic和Gemini训模型、技术预测、英雄主义已过去 scaling law reward signal multi-agent VLA context management continual learning\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-05-11-zhangxiaojun-ai-是浪-冲浪的人不重要-模型大厂研究员的自白/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dddeb887e7c6825c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">3:50:35</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0511</span></div>\n<h2>AI 是浪，冲浪的人不重要：模型大厂研究员的自白</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">预训练没有到头，撞墙的人多半是自己有 bug；AI 本质是简单的，因为它能做实验。个人英雄主义时代已经过去，现在拼的是组织系统性和靠谱。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>4</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">模型训练</span><span class=\"tag\">组织管理</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"EP3 安娜：人道救援十年，她说看见是改变的开始 HPV Labor Market DIC\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-05-08-xiaotianzhang-决定产妇能否活下来的-往往不是医术-而是一条路-一笔钱/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/2006c77d32fa5b8f-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"小\"><span class=\"dur\">1:18:30</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">小天章</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0508</span></div>\n<h2>决定产妇能否活下来的，往往不是医术，而是一条路、一笔钱</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">她做了十几年战地妇产科医生后发现，救不救得活产妇常常不取决于医术，而是有没有路、有没有钱、有没有人签字——这促使她转向公共卫生。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">人道救援</span><span class=\"tag\">无国界医生</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Rolex Oyster case rotor testimonee établissage Quartz Crisis\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-05-03-acquired-石英表几乎团灭瑞士手表业-rolex靠的是等待而非创新/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ab663b0e688c62d9-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">4:51:25</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Acquired</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0503</span></div>\n<h2>石英表几乎团灭瑞士手表业，Rolex靠的是等待而非创新</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">石英表几乎打垮瑞士表业时，Rolex没有跟风转型，而是等对手慌乱退场后，再用验证过的高端策略反扑，靠的是独立公司才有的耐心。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">奢侈品牌</span><span class=\"tag\">瑞士制造</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Costco Cross-docking SKU Net 30\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-05-02-acquired-最便宜的零售商-却拥有全美最有钱的顾客/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/b464597610793199-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">2:53:29</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Acquired</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0502</span></div>\n<h2>最便宜的零售商，却拥有全美最有钱的顾客</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Costco 把会员费和大包装门槛变成筛选器，挡住对现金流敏感的人，剩下的会员平均年收入12.5万美元，远高于沃尔玛顾客。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">零售</span><span class=\"tag\">会员制</span>\n</div></div></a>"]